{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"24":"Wages (Kitab Al-Ijarah)"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":3416,"hadithnumber_last":3570,"arabicnumber_first":3416,"arabicnumber_last":3570,"name_native":"كتاب الإجارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3516,"arabicnumber":3516,"text":"حدثنا عبد الله بن محمد النفيلي، حدثنا سفيان، عن ابراهيم بن ميسرة، سمع عمرو بن الشريد، سمع ابا رافع، سمع النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يقول \" الجار احق بسقبه","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (6977)"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":101}}]}